      "suffix": "Finish: flat muted offset print on dun, yellowed cream paper, brush-ink outlines, plain sturdy Soviet-era people, the subject floating on bare paper with wide margins.",
      "notes": "Identical to F4 except the paper words: 'dun, yellowed cream'. Isolates paper brightness."
    },
